{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：21:26 2026-09-23 HKT</p>\n\n<p>黎昭昇馬房的「越駿聯歡」上季初跑谷草一六五○米即以短距離僅負跑第三，今晚此駒復岀跑同程，即使巴度停賽而改配梁家俊，一樣發揮岀水準，直路上在大外檔上前，終點前越過一度岀頭，由蔡明紹策騎的「同心」，贏得在港首場頭馬，另外何澤堯和潘明輝的坐騎「本領非凡」和「揀馬之皇」分别跑第三和第四，令今場由四名華將構成四重彩。</p>\n<p>本地騎師梁家俊今季成績優秀，今晚第五場香港鄉村俱樂部挑戰盃，由梁家俊策騎黎廄的「越駿聯歡」贏馬兼捧盃。</p>\n<p>賽後練馬師黎昭昇說：「『越駿聯歡』上季已經曾經有接近的走勢，此馬需要時間適應水土，牠在晨課時有時很懶惰，很難知道牠的確實狀態，比較難駕馭。由於巴度停賽，今仗由梁家俊策騎，而後駒發揮得宜。我想藉此機會感謝馬主的支持，願意給予耐性，此馬將來可以應付千八米至二千米。」</p>\n<h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d00b6d9f54d999c36a47cd0bf6983153/2026-09/3b5d15e3-b515-4581-a35f-17272e9e76ba.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e9ef982449f172cccb6fd4598a01ae67/2026-09/4d8e151c-70ba-41d6-83ef-d285208effc6.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6517a17229d165112720d40538a31a1e/2026-09/6c67951b-e9e1-4b6a-84f9-11885aff8a9a.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0a8fa1810903f8f9ac84c5274b4151de/2026-09/9c41ffae-9776-474a-9027-d9302ffe82d9.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8fe265cb5852ed40db2dd7dbb668e987/2026-09/52e724ff-00a3-44ab-863f-e946294fa1ac.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d2622aa219718852df3c5158938bcb9d/2026-09/625f201b-8dc4-4994-a459-1e812fe1481f.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/addcedac8962c9b7c1e38c2dfcb0d134/2026-09/849cb8fd-c94c-49fa-87f0-90fb41f022d1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4d1b413051d764a73f4ba4025d2d61fc/2026-09/4906afd8-63bf-4082-bd0b-9894a67a900c.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/057e582717cb260efb49164b2b7bacf3/2026-09/79798909-0672-4dbe-a404-c5eb193e6fba.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4dc8e08882fc804b104d81e4064e0111/2026-09/ab7d8044-90e6-4698-b48f-cd20310353df.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/38b0ab233d6d46f8ebc8646ae7561317/2026-09/aed1eaed-ae18-4b69-8f13-9000e9510f94.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d9a6119a708f301f130cee8103130390/2026-09/af6fdc2d-08e4-4898-8025-a1c089db66e1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4bd0b0a66923c4074492f8ca8bb0fbb0/2026-09/c1ffd887-7731-4a10-8a3b-da51e8253951.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3b5e62e82994226b38b5f0ae3b88bdfc/2026-09/c2f9f0ff-72d1-4686-9828-1845caf32abd.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b44680c8aa8aeb787810e5ea80498938/2026-09/e9499c30-acba-4658-a2c9-c08588c9062d.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T13:38:22.291450+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":374,"images":15,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}